\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy Spirit, truth Divine,
\par Dawn upon this soul of mine;
\par Word of God, and inward light,
\par Wake my spirit, clear my sight.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Holy Spirit, love Divine,
\par Glow within this heart of mine,
\par Kindle every high desire,
\par Perish self in Thy pure fire.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Holy Spirit, power Divine,
\par Fill and nerve this will of mine;
\par By Thee may I strongly live,
\par Bravely bear, and nobly strive.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Holy Spirit, right Divine,
\par King within my conscience reign;
\par Be my Lord, and I shall be
\par Firmly bound, for ever free.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Holy Spirit, peace Divine,
\par Still this restless heart of mine,
\par Speak to calm this tossing sea,
\par Stayed in Thy tranquility.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Holy Spirit, joy Divine,
\par Gladden Thou this heart of mine;
\par In the desert ways I'll sing:
\par Spring, O Well, for ever spring!
\par \tab\tab\tab Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

